{"asset_key":"mn2/herohub_story_10412170","episode":"mn2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10412170","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1041217001:1":{"text":"何度見ても、カブラの大剣は恐ろしいわね……","source_cn":"无论看到多少次，卡夫拉这把大剑的威慑力还是很强……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B6A1BB9482D6363","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041217002:1":{"text":"見た目に騙されてはいけませんぞ。この剣は軽くて薄く、片手でも扱えるので大したことありません！","source_cn":"不可被外表欺骗，此剑纤薄轻盈，吾尚可单手挥动，汝等必定...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x704994DD94CC1D2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041217003:1":{"text":"……カブラ、それはあなたにとって、でしょう。ライカなら持ち上げられないわ。","source_cn":"……卡夫拉，那只是对你来说。莱卡拿不起来的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE018159C78831473","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041217004:1":{"text":"あなた以外にその剣を扱える人は、茨の隊員でもいないわ。","source_cn":"除你之外，也没有第二个荆棘队员能运用了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6809952BB051BBEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"ライカ","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卡夫拉":{"text":"カブラ","source":"卡夫拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:帕瑞莎":{"text":"パリーサ","source":"帕瑞莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_cou